## 🎯 Search Decision Tree (MANDATORY PATH)

```
User requests code
  ↓
🚨 STEP 1: Did you call lulu_get_context? 
  ❌ No → 🛑 STOP! Call it first (MANDATORY!)
  ✅ Yes → Continue
  ↓
🚨 STEP 2: Call lulu_search with specific query (MANDATORY!)
  → Use 3-6 descriptive words
  → Get top 8 results minimum
  ↓
🚨 STEP 3: Review ALL results (MANDATORY!)
  → Check similarity scores for EVERY result
  → Document findings
  ↓
🚨 STEP 4: Decision Point (MANDATORY!)
  ↓
  ├─ Similarity ≥90%
  │    → 🚨 MUST REUSE exactly (import and use as-is)
  │    → NO CREATION ALLOWED!
  │
  ├─ Similarity 85-89%
  │    → 🚨 MUST REUSE or adapt (no new code!)
  │    → Ask user: "Found similar code at 87% match, reusing it"
  │
  ├─ Similarity 70-84%
  │    → ✅ Use as reference pattern
  │    → Create new following same conventions
  │    → Still call lulu_get_guidance first!
  │
  └─ Similarity <70%
       → ✅ Create new code
       → Still call lulu_get_guidance first!
       → Follow project structure from lulu-code-organization
```

**REMEMBER: Similarity ≥85% = NO NEW CODE! You MUST reuse existing code!**

