## 🎓 Remember (MANDATORY PRINCIPLES)

1. **🚨 SEARCH FIRST** - Before creating anything (NO EXCEPTIONS!)
2. **🚨 BE SPECIFIC** - Use descriptive search queries (3-6 words minimum)
3. **🚨 REVIEW ALL** - Check top 5-8 results minimum (don't skip any!)
4. **🚨 REUSE ≥85%** - Don't recreate existing code (MANDATORY!)
5. **✅ PATTERN ≥70%** - Follow existing patterns (use as reference)
6. **✅ CREATE <70%** - Only when truly new (still use lulu_get_guidance!)

### **The Golden Rules:**

> **"If similarity ≥85%, you MUST reuse. No new code allowed."**

> **"If you didn't search, you didn't do the task correctly."**

> **"The best code is code you don't have to write!"** 🌸

### **Enforcement:**

- **Similarity ≥85%** = 🚨 **BLOCKED from creating new code** - MUST reuse!
- **No search** = 🚨 **BLOCKED from creating code** - MUST search first!
- **No review** = 🚨 **BLOCKED from creating code** - MUST review results!

**No exceptions. No shortcuts. Use Lulu or don't code!** 🚨
